Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 04:48:44 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] lane-152 checker F7: the old base is tag b10454, not b10453 -
 correction of record

git describe --tags --exact-match 4df29be4f = b10454. b10453 is 3cb7ffb1a, a different commit. This file carried the wrong label before this lane and I re-asserted it without re-deriving, into commit subject 915a510fd and the upstream pin_review, before my own checker caught it. Every SHA is correct throughout; only the label was wrong. Commit subjects are history and are not rewritten, so this row is the correction of record. The staged engine directory models/engines/arifi-b10453-union/ carries the same wrong label - flag it at restage rather than propagating it into arifi-b10481-union.
---
 tools/arifi-sync/sources.json | 9 ++++++++-
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/tools/arifi-sync/sources.json b/tools/arifi-sync/sources.json
index 4254424a7..ac78dcc76 100644
--- a/tools/arifi-sync/sources.json
+++ b/tools/arifi-sync/sources.json
@@ -22,7 +22,14 @@
